# Copy to ".env.local".
#
# No key set  -> the widget runs against MockProductService (no backend needed).
# Key set     -> it calls the real GetProductForWidget endpoint.
#
# Leaving the base URL empty makes requests go to /api/... which the Vite dev
# proxy (see vite.config.ts) forwards to staging — that's the easiest way to
# avoid CORS while developing. Set the full URL only if you have CORS sorted.
VITE_SAIZ_API_KEY=
VITE_SAIZ_BASE_URL=
